WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.269
Intel built a

00:00:01.081 --> 00:00:02.425
monospace font with

00:00:02.237 --> 00:00:03.734
low-vision developers

00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:05.409
Intel One Mono

00:00:05.221 --> 00:00:06.246
is an expressive

00:00:06.058 --> 00:00:07.402
monospaced font built

00:00:07.214 --> 00:00:08.287
for clarity and

00:00:08.098 --> 00:00:08.982
legibility

00:00:09.148 --> 00:00:09.772
and it is

00:00:09.584 --> 00:00:10.397
free with an

00:00:10.221 --> 00:00:11.494
open-source license

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:13.248
Frere-Jones Type designed

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.015
it with Intel's

00:00:13.827 --> 00:00:14.663
brand team

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.086
It was designed

00:00:15.898 --> 00:00:16.947
for developers with

00:00:16.758 --> 00:00:17.725
low vision

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:18.609
and a panel

00:00:18.421 --> 00:00:19.612
of low-vision and

00:00:19.459 --> 00:00:21.015
legally blind developers

00:00:20.921 --> 00:00:22.123
gave feedback at

00:00:22.018 --> 00:00:22.961
every stage

00:00:23.103 --> 00:00:24.152
to cut fatigue

00:00:24.376 --> 00:00:25.826
eyestrain and coding

00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:26.322
errors

00:00:26.846 --> 00:00:27.966
It covers over

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:29.463
200 languages using

00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:30.313
the Latin script

00:00:30.478 --> 00:00:31.303
and comes in

00:00:31.115 --> 00:00:31.987
four weights

00:00:32.046 --> 00:00:32.636
Light

00:00:32.872 --> 00:00:33.614
Regular

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.077
Medium and Bold

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.409
each with matching

00:00:36.221 --> 00:00:37.058
italics

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:38.604
Full story on

00:00:38.415 --> 00:00:39.311
the dashboard
